menu "PCAP Capture"

    config PCAP_CAPTURE
        bool "Enable PCAP packet capture"
        default n
        help
            Enable live packet capture streamed over TCP (port 19000)
            to Wireshark or tcpdump.  Adds a TCP server task, a ring
            buffer (~16-32 KB RAM depending on target), and the 'pcap'
            CLI command.  Also enables allow_monitor / deny_monitor ACL
            actions and the PCAP section on the config web page.

            Disable to save flash and RAM on constrained targets.

endmenu
